## 2.3.1 - 2026-05-24

- Added runtime dependency `markdown-it-py~=3.0` for token-backed markdown scope parsing in quality checks.
- Hardened `MarkdownItScopeProvider` with token-backed fenced/indented/inline handling and safer fallback behavior.
- Enforced explicit severity ordering (`critical > high > medium > low > info/unknown`) for normalized warning output.
- Added runtime release-trigger summary payload coverage for `quality_check` release-gate mode.
- Added mixed-markdown torture regression coverage to verify code/example suppression with lifecycle warning preservation.
- Fixed repeated-identical-inline localization so duplicate inline literals map to distinct occurrences.

